<!DOCTYPE html>
<%# The kit's Sign-In Page layout (accounts.html#sign-in-page), for a sign-in
    or developer sign-in page: a roof with only the wordmark, the page and a
    small footer. %>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%= render "cmu/head" %>
  </head>
  <body class="no-js cmu-app">
    <div id="container">
      <header>
        <div class="roof<%= " #{CmuWebKilt.config.roof_class}" if CmuWebKilt.config.roof_class %>">
          <div>
            <a class="wordmark" href="https://www.cmu.edu/">Carnegie Mellon University</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>
      <%= yield %>
      <div class="cmu-sign-in-footer" role="contentinfo">
        <ul>
          <% if (email = CmuWebKilt.config.contact_email) %>
            <li>Need help? Email <%= mail_to email %></li>
          <% end %>
          <li><a href="https://www.cmu.edu/legal/">Legal Info</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <%# No menu, but the template's script expects one %>
      <nav id="nav" hidden><ul></ul></nav>
    </div>
    <%= render "cmu/template_scripts" %>
  </body>
</html>
